  "block.simpleoctets.mixed_octet": "Mixed Octet Cell",
  "jei.simpleoctets.info.octets": "Right-click places the octet a quarter block in front of the hit point, in the clicked corner or next to the clicked octet. Octets of different materials share one cell. Breaking takes the whole cell; sneaking breaks only the octet you look at, also the looked-at corner of a full block. Eight octets of one material become its full block. Sneak + right-click with an empty hand takes the clicked octet out. The Shapecutter (Simple Blocks; without it the stonecutter) cuts 8 from the full block, 8 craft back into it.",
  "jei.simpleoctets.info.melon_octet": "Sneak + right-click a block with a melon slice to place it as a melon octet (without sneaking it is eaten). Each melon octet drops one melon slice.",
